  "number": 5873,
  "title": "Fix flaky tests and remove `checkAccessibility` overrides",
  "body": "## Changelog Entry\n\nNot required, development only.\n\n## Description\n\nFixes 2 flaky tests and removes `window.checkAccessibility = async () => {}` from tests, which disabled the accessibility check for the whole test. Remaining known violations are skipped explicitly with `skipCheckAccessibility`, scoped to the failing variants and snapshots, with a TODO.\n\n## Design\n\n`react-scroll-to-bottom` may mistake the first scroll after its scroll animation as a resize while sticky, and scroll back to the bottom. `pageObjects.scrollToTop()` now scrolls again, like a user would.\n\n## Specific Changes\n\n- `pageObjects.scrollToTop()`: scroll again when the transcript snaps back to the bottom, fixes flaky `scrollToEndButton.containerSize.html`\n- `activity/legacy/unknownAttachment.html`: wait for the live region warning before asserting\n- Removed obsolete `window.checkAccessibility` overrides from 11 tests\n- Replaced the remaining overrides with `skipCheckAccessibility` and a TODO:\n   - `part-grouping/status.html`, `part-grouping/index.html`: part grouping remounts when its first activity changes, `aria-activedescendant` points to the removed group\n   - `side-by-side/index.html`: deprecated Copilot custom variant puts elements other than articles in `role=\"feed\"`; color contrast in the \"View code\" dialog\n   - `markdown/vnext/markdownStreaming.html`: markdown `#` renders a level-one heading\n- `CHANGELOG.md`: moved #5865 and #5872 entries from 4.19.2 to Unreleased, they were merged after the release\n\n- [x] I have added tests and executed them locally\n- [ ] I have updated `CHANGELOG.md`\n- [ ] I have updated documentation\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n> This section is for contributors to review your work.\n\n- [ ] Accessibility reviewed (tab order, content readability, alt text, color contrast)\n- [ ] Browser and platform compatibilities reviewed\n- [ ] CSS styles reviewed (minimal rules, no `z-index`)\n- [ ] Documents reviewed (docs, samples, live demo)\n- [ ] Internationalization reviewed (strings, unit formatting)\n- [ ] `package.json` and `package-lock.json` reviewed\n- [ ] Security reviewed (no data URIs, check for nonce leak)\n- [ ] Tests reviewed (coverage, legitimacy)\n",
